    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275012</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_010_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>すげー、かっこよすぎ……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa, this is
way too cool...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275320</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_010_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;超古代都市トール&lt;White&gt;だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is the &lt;Red&gt;Ancient
City of Thor&lt;White&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275320</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_010_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>この街の
マザーコンピューターシステムに
時間転移の機能があるんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This town's Mother
Computer System includes
a time travel function.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275392</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_010_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ルー……クルール？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Reuu... Couleuru?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275484</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_010_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ま、百聞は一見にしかず、だ。
行こうぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, "a picture's worth a
thousand words." Let's go,
so you can see it for yourself.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275584</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_010_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ねぇ、エト。このまま、
戻っちゃってもいいの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, Ethos. Is it
really okay for us to
just go back like this?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275760</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_010_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>本当はまだ自分が何者か、
ひっかかってるんじゃない？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You do still want to know
who you really are, don't you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276196</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_010_015&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>前に&lt;Dio&gt;が
言ってたでしょ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, &lt;Dio&gt; said it
before, didn't he?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276196</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_010_016&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>別にぼくが妖精でも何でも、
何も変わらないって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whether I'm a fairy or not, it
won't really change anything.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276276</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_010_017&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そんなことオレ、
言ったか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh. Did I say that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276340</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_010_018&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>言ったよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You did.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276592</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_010_021&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;ヴァルハラ町&lt;White&gt;のことが
決着ついたら、エトのこと
調べる、わたし</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Once things in &lt;Red&gt;Valhalla Town&lt;White&gt;
have settled down, I'll look
into it for you, Ethos.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276692</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_010_022&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>え……あ、いや、
別にそんなの……
……ほんとに？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh... Well, you don't...
really have to... Um,
are you sure?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276784</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_010_023&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>エトには、
いつも明るくいて
ほしいから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, I like it best
when you're bright
and cheerful, so.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276856</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_010_024&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ありがとう、&lt;Mel&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thank you, &lt;Mel&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276964</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_180_010_025&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>っし！　早くこっちのカタつけて、
戻ろうぜ、元の時代に</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right! Let's wrap things
up here and go back
to our own time!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
